															<img loading="lazy" width="1280" height="850" src="https://www.capetown.travel/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/Stellenbosch_vineyard_cape_town-1-1.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-154815" alt="" srcset="https://www.capetown.travel/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/Stellenbosch_vineyard_cape_town-1-1.jpg 1280w, https://www.capetown.travel/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/Stellenbosch_vineyard_cape_town-1-1-600x398.jpg 600w, https://www.capetown.travel/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/Stellenbosch_vineyard_cape_town-1-1-300x199.jpg 300w, https://www.capetown.travel/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/Stellenbosch_vineyard_cape_town-1-1-1024x680.jpg 1024w, https://www.capetown.travel/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/Stellenbosch_vineyard_cape_town-1-1-768x510.jpg 768w, https://www.capetown.travel/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/Stellenbosch_vineyard_cape_town-1-1-200x133.jpg 200w, https://www.capetown.travel/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/Stellenbosch_vineyard_cape_town-1-1-50x33.jpg 50w, https://www.capetown.travel/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/Stellenbosch_vineyard_cape_town-1-1-800x531.jpg 800w, https://www.capetown.travel/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/Stellenbosch_vineyard_cape_town-1-1-708x470.jpg 708w" sizes="(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px" />															</div>
